{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1144203-slain-fomori-and-their-banes","id":1144203,"title":"Slain Fomori and their Banes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-26T14:51:32-07:00","id":1144203,"title":"Slain Fomori and their Banes","content":"After a fomori is destroyed, what happens to the Bane that possessed it? Is it &quot;released&quot; and now existing in the Umbra? Or is it &quot;destroyed&quot; in the sense that it is now reforming in its spiritual home and likely in slumber? Or something else?<br /> <br /> I've been ruling the Bane is reforming and will be in slumber for some time. Is that what others do?<br /> <br /> A similar question is what happens when a Fetish is destroyed. Is the spirit released, or is it to reforming somewhere in the umbra?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T15:04:05-07:00","id":1144211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1144203-slain-fomori-and-their-banes#post1144203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After a fomori is destroyed, what happens to the Bane that possessed it? Is it &quot;released&quot; and now existing in the Umbra? Or is it &quot;destroyed&quot; in the sense that it is now reforming in its spiritual home and likely in slumber? Or something else?</div> </div> </div> </div>Released into the Umbra.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I've been ruling the Bane is reforming and will be in slumber for some time. Is that what others do? </div> </div> </div>Only if the characters killed the fomor with something to damage the bane (e.g. a spirit axe) or both host and bane simultaneously.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A similar question is what happens when a Fetish is destroyed. Is the spirit released, or is it to reforming somewhere in the umbra? </div> </div> </div>It depends on how long it's been in the Fetish, but it generally gets released without the need to reform.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T17:48:25-07:00","id":1144240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1144203-slain-fomori-and-their-banes?p=1144211#post1144211\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> It depends on how long it's been in the Fetish, but it generally gets released without the need to reform.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh if I could ask on Talens? How likely is a spirit who was &quot;Drafted&quot; into being bound into a Talen (Its considered more acceptable then forcible binding into Fetishes because its short term) To immediately seek redress?<br /> <br /> Or will they probaly know their superiors would NOT smile on them plagueing a pack facing off against BSD's or Formori?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 09-26-2017, 08:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T18:47:30-07:00","id":1144248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1144203-slain-fomori-and-their-banes?p=1144240#post1144240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh if I could ask on Talens? How likely is a spirit who was &quot;Drafted&quot; into being bound into a Talen (Its considered more acceptable then forcible binding into Fetishes because its short term) To immediately seek redress?<br /> <br /> Or will they probaly know their superiors would NOT smile on them plagueing a pack facing off against BSD's or Formori?</div> </div> </div> </div>Talens are even more transient, so unless the spirit was beaten into empowering them, using them will probably get the spirit leaping right out and doing what they will. This might not be a direct confrontation, particularly if the spirit is not so impressive, but it can talk to other spirits...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T05:17:58-07:00","id":1144347,"title":"","content":"Yes and i